@ Frame driver for zone card removal display sequence.
@ Reads state_word from [0x0201bcc0] (DAT_0803df00=0x0201bcc0);
@ extracts player_id (r4=bit15), slot_idx (r5=hword[+2]), zone flags (bits from hword[+6]).
@ Reads four bit flags (r3=bit0, [sp]=bit1, [sp+4]=bit2, [sp+8]=bit3).
@ Step 0: if bit3==0 writes hword[+4] to [base+0x80c] (step lock init);
@ dispatches op=0x45 (remove animation).
@ Step 1: polls play_ui_effect=0x45; on done: if bit0 calls write_field_slot_bit_by_player;
