@ Frame-tick state machine for the equip card detach animation sequence.
@ No APCS input params (reads player_id/slot from [0x0201bcc0]).
@ Reads step counter from [0x0201c4d0] (0x0201bcc0+0x810) and dispatches:
@ Step 0: checks hand_count from [base+4]; if non-zero: writes [0x0201c4d0]:=player_id+1,
